# {{project-name | title_case}}

A [jackdaw](https://github.com/jbuehler23/jackdaw) editor extension.

- Open this folder in jackdaw and use Rebuild Project to load or update it.
- The extension surface (operators, panels, menus, keybindings) lives
  behind `jackdaw_extension`; see the `examples/extension/` directory in the
  jackdaw repository for working samples of each.
- `cargo check` works standalone for IDE support; the editor performs
  the real builds into `.jackdaw/` (gitignored).
